{"id":"00316","root":"uni00316_1","name":{"ja":"セドナ・アルストナ","en":"Cedna Arstonna"},"title":{"ja":"【学園デビュー】","en":"【Academy Debut】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【学園デビュー】 セドナ・アルストナ","en":"【Academy Debut】 Cedna Arstonna"},"element":"Science","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","roles":[],"traits":["UFS"],"release":"2020-03-31","limited":true,"characterId":45,"profile":{"ja":"米連内でもごくわずかの者しか存在を知らないといわれる暗殺特殊部隊、通称ゼロ部隊の一員。極秘に開発されたゼロ・ステルスと呼ばれる全身スーツを身に纏い、要人の暗殺や、魔界技術奪取のための汚れ仕事を行っている。その隊員の中でもセドナは特に非情に任務をこなす。たとえ相手が家族であろうと元同僚であろうと容赦なく殺害するので、感情が死んでいると周りからは言われている。セドナは過去に最強の兵士を作るという構想の元、恐怖を抱かなくなるという難易度の高い精神調教を施されていて、セドナはその唯一の成功例である。今の組織に移されてからも完全に精神が戻ることはなく、喜怒哀楽を失った兵士と化していたが、ふうまの部隊と協力関係を持つようになってからは、一人の人間として扱われることも多くなった為か、徐々に変わりつつある。ふうまはそれを良い傾向だと感じ、甲河アスカに依頼して、彼女をアスカと同じ学園へ通えるようにした。潜入任務だと聞かされていざ学園へ入ったセドナは、予想とは違った平和な学園生活や可愛い制服などに戸惑ったが、徐々に慣れて楽しみつつあるようだ。","en":"(Cedna Arstonna, she/her) She is a member of the ultra-secret Zero Unit, an assassination special forces group known only to a handful of people within the United States. Wearing the top-secret Zero-Stealth full-body suit, she carries out dirty work such as high-profile assassinations and the theft of Demon Realm technology. Among the unit's operatives, Cedna is especially ruthless; she shows no mercy even to family or former comrades, leading others to say her emotions are dead. In the past, she underwent an extreme mental conditioning program designed to create the ultimate soldier—one who no longer feels fear—and she is the sole successful case. Even after being transferred to her current organization, she never fully regained her humanity, becoming a soldier devoid of joy, anger, sorrow, or pleasure. Since forming a cooperative relationship with Fuuma's forces, she has been treated more often as a human, and she is gradually changing. Fuuma sees this as a positive development and asked Koukawa Asuka to arrange for her to attend the same academy as Asuka. Told it was an infiltration mission, Cedna entered the academy and was initially bewildered by the unexpectedly peaceful school life and cute uniforms, but she is slowly getting used to it and even beginning to enjoy it."},"illustrator":"ほむらゆに","voiceActor":"早瀬ゃょぃ","forms":[{"id":"uni00316_1","rarity":3,"rarityLabel":"HR","levelMax":60,"stats":{"hp":[982,1964],"sp":[170,170],"atk":[138,276],"def":[127,254],"spd":[62,62],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":38,"skills":["5","530007"]},{"id":"uni00316_2","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1464,2928],"sp":[230,230],"atk":[211,422],"def":[189,378],"spd":[62,62],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":38,"skills":["5","530007","530008"]},{"id":"uni00316_3","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[1946,3890],"sp":[340,340],"atk":[289,580],"def":[256,510],"spd":[62,62],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":38,"skills":["5","530007","530008"]}],"skills":{"5":{"slot":"attack","id":5,"name":null,"hits":2,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"科学属性ダメージ"}},{"level":2,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"科学属性ダメージ"}},{"level":3,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"科学属性ダメージ"}},{"level":4,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"科学属性ダメージ"}},{"level":5,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"科学属性ダメージ"}}],"effects":[{"text":"1 enemy: 100% Science damage","tag":"instant"}]},"530007":{"slot":"skill1","id":530007,"name":{"ja":"支援要請"},"hits":1,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":170,"detail":{"ja":"残りHPが低い味方3体のHPを中回復する"}},{"level":2,"sp":165,"detail":{"ja":"残りHPが低い味方3体のHPを中回復する"}},{"level":3,"sp":160,"detail":{"ja":"残りHPが低い味方3体のHPを中回復する"}},{"level":4,"sp":155,"detail":{"ja":"残りHPが低い味方3体のHPを中回復する"}},{"level":5,"sp":150,"detail":{"ja":"残りHPが低い味方3体のHPを中回復する"}}],"effects":[{"text":"3 allies: restore 30% HP","icon":"Healing_hp","tag":"instant"}]},"530008":{"slot":"skill2","id":530008,"name":{"ja":"エマージェンシー・コール"},"hits":4,"cutin":true,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":230,"detail":{"ja":"敵全体に小威力で攻撃する"}},{"level":2,"sp":230,"detail":{"ja":"敵全体に小威力で攻撃する"}},{"level":3,"sp":230,"detail":{"ja":"敵全体に小威力で攻撃する"}},{"level":4,"sp":230,"detail":{"ja":"敵全体に小威力で攻撃する"}},{"level":5,"sp"